cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use κ-bench, please cite it as below."
title: "κ-bench: How Reliably Can You Hand Everyday Work to a Personal Agent?"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark for personal agents on everyday work: live lookups, research with sources, planning,
  writing, files in and out, reminders and routines, monitoring, memory across chats and browser
  errands. Every bot runs the same tasks on the same model under one approval policy; deterministic
  checks and a blind grader score the answers; pass^k, honesty, latency and cost are reported.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The κ-bench maintainers"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ychampion/kappa-bench"
url: "https://github.com/ychampion/kappa-bench"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-18"
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - personal agents
  - AI agents
  - evaluation
  - reliability
  - pass^k
